{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. Search for objects, pick them up if nearby, store them in safe place and execute task. If no object, scan surroundings. list of available nodes: <Action ID = PickUpObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToObjectStorage    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectSafeToStore    /> <Action ID = StoreObject    /> <SubTree ID = PerformTask    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    /> <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    />",
    "BT": {
